{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481310/extras/image_2025-05-02_010504098.png?t=1746195154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TeamJumpers: New Reality, is a complete remake/remaster of an old indie game made back in 2018. The focus on this one is interdimensional travel. Throughout your journey You will be discovering <i>new realities</i> with challenging bosses<i>, a simple yet fun combat system, and secrets to be revealed, this world is yours to explore! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u2022 Traverse New realities by yourself, or with a friend if you'd like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u2022 Both players have their own unique ability! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u2022 Explore across different bosses and uncover the secrets of the multiverse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u2022 Fight a variety of different enemies across 3 different dimensions and make your way to the end to fight 'the one pulling the strings'</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Power of Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1481310/f22b88cd8ddc22fad4906a969b1706f321b09af0.jpg"},{"name":"Plain and Simple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1481310/228baa4e5edfa3329a66deb891ff84022f138996.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Crisis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1481310/e4f7e218481bdbaaada46e920716acca3d36a6d7.jpg"},{"name":"The Flipside","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1481310/acf41fa979eeea6a0f755f02af99d82ffdcddd6e.jpg"},{"name":"Here Fishy Fishy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1481310/ce025ef2e7f7c4145572cb03b3487687e8983107.jpg"},